          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#ff5a00]/10 text-[#ff5a00] text-[11px] font-bold">MENDESAK (RAWAN LONGSOR)</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#71717a]">#DISB-2026-0891</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-[#09090b]">Bantuan Rutilahu Darurat Rumah Roboh Ciwidey</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#71717a] mt-1">Mustahik: <strong>Ibu Aminah (48 Thn)</strong> • NIK: 3204121908750003 • Desa Lebakmuncang, Ciwidey</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#f8fafc] border border-[#ececee] grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
